2.5 Which tests must be repeated after changes?
Change Request	Tests to re-run	Reason
CR-01	TC-06, TC-07, TC-11, TC-12 and relevant transition tests	Verify the new triggers, 3-second deadline and safe handling of faults during different robot states.
CR-02	TC-10 and TC-01–TC-05 under concurrent load	Verify that the system supports 20 robots without breaking command processing, security or reporting.
CR-03	TC-03, TC-04, TC-05 and command-related regression tests	Verify authentication and role checks for every command path.
All affected tests should be run again after the relevant code changes. Regression testing should also check that unrelated safety behaviour still works.
